info.description:
Landlord dashboard endpoints for Rent Room platform.

Base URL: {{baseUrl}}

All endpoints require LANDLORD or ADMIN role: Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

Landlords always see their own data. Admins can pass ?landlordId=<uuid> to view any landlord's data.

Rate limit: 30 req / 60s (global default).

